## Interface: 120105, 16001
## Title: Craftonomics
## Notes: Your profit or loss on every craft and crafting order, a Best crafts tab of what's worth crafting, a Ledger of how it really went, and its own auction house window. Works alone or with TSM and Auctionator. Type /craftonomics for options. Formerly Craft Profit.
